摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Design aesthetics skill pack for DeepSeek Harness (DSH) - keeps vibe-coded websites away from the AI look. 6 styles: dark-saas, apple-minimal, neo-neumorphism, brutalism, glassmorphism, japanese-minimal.","id":"gh:1334360795","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-design-skills","slug":"zhaiyateng/dsh-design-skills","topics":["deepseek-harness","design-skills","design-system","dsh-plugin","ui","vibe-coding","web-design"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Design aesthetics skill pack for DeepSeek Harness (DSH) - keeps vibe-coded websites away from the AI"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" look. 6 styles: dark-saas, apple-minimal, neo-neumorphism, brutalism, glassmorphism, japanese-minim"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"ok. 6 styles: dark-saas, apple-minimal, neo-neumorphism, brutalism, glassmorphism, japanese-minimal."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-design-skills"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Design aesthetics skill pack for DeepSeek Harness (DSH) — keeps your vibe-coded websites away from"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"cs skill pack for DeepSeek Harness (DSH) — keeps your vibe-coded websites away from the \"AI look\".**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness 设计美学技能包 —— 让 vibe coding 出来的网站摆脱「AI 味」。"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> 模型不缺\"怎么建站\"，缺\"怎么建得好看\"。本技能包把经过验证的设计风格提炼成\n> 可执行的规范（token + 组件规则 + 禁用清单 + 验收清单），模型匹配后自动遵循。\n>\n> Models "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"don't lack \"how to build a site\" — they lack \"how to make it look good\".\n> This pack distills proven"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" design aesthetics into executable specs (tokens +\n> component rules + forbidden lists + acceptance "},{"id":"p5s4","text":"hetics into executable specs (tokens +\n> component rules + forbidden lists + acceptance checklists)."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> 🖼️ **Try all 10 styles live** → **zhaiyateng.github.io/dsh-design-skills**\n>\n> 🖼️ **在线体验全部 10 种风格*"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"* → **zhaiyateng.github.io/dsh-design-skills**"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Preview / 效果预览"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Same product (a fictional agent-orchestration console, \"Relay\"), ten aesthetics —\nthe exact \"before "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"/ after\" of what these skills do to your vibe-coded site:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"同一产品（虚构的 Agent 编排平台 \"Relay\"）的十种风格效果——这就是本技能包\n对 vibe coding 产物的实际影响："},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| `dark-saas` (dark, Linear-inspired) | `apple-minimal` (minimal white) | `neo-neumorphism` (soft UI"},{"id":"p11s2","text":") | `brutalism` (hard-edge) | `glassmorphism` (frosted glass) |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| `japanese-minimal` (zen serif) | `bento-grid` (modular cards) | `cyberpunk` (neon) | `vaporwave` ("},{"id":"p12s2","text":"synthwave) | `art-deco` (gold & emerald) |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Demo source: `examples/dark-saas-landing.html` · `examples/apple-minimal-landing.html` · `examples/n"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"eo-neumorphism-landing.html` · `examples/brutalism-landing.html` · `examples/glassmorphism-landing.h"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"tml` · `examples/japanese-minimal-landing.html` · `examples/bento-grid-landing.html` · `examples/cyb"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"erpunk-landing.html` · `examples/vaporwave-landing.html` · `examples/art-deco-landing.html`"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## What's inside / 包含的技能"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Skill | 风格 / Style | 适用场景 / Use for |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| `dark-saas` | 深色 SaaS（Linear 式）\nDark SaaS, Linear-inspired | 开发者工具、数据看板、AI 产品、SaaS 后台\nDev tools, d"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ashboards, AI products |\n| `apple-minimal` | 极简白（Apple 式）\nMinimal white, Apple-style | 产品官网、落地页、作品集\n"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"Product sites, landing pages, portfolios |\n| `neo-neumorphism` | 新拟态 / Soft UI\nNeumorphism | 个人主页、健康"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"/理财 App、演示 Demo\nPersonal pages, lifestyle apps, demos |\n| `brutalism` | 粗野主义 / Brutalism\nHard-edge, "},{"id":"p16s5","text":"neo-brutalist | 实验性产品、艺术/独立项目、开发者工具\nExperimental products, indie sites, dev tools |\n| `glassmorphism"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"` | 毛玻璃 / Glassmorphism\nFrosted glass | AI 产品、SaaS 官网、Dashboard、演示 Demo\nAI products, SaaS sites, das"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"hboards, demos |\n| `japanese-minimal` | 日式极简 / Japanese Minimal\nZen serif, wabi-sabi | 文化/美学类产品、博客、艺"},{"id":"p16s8","text":"术展、和风品牌\nCultural/aesthetic products, blogs, art sites |\n| `bento-grid` | 便当盒 / Bento Grid\nModular ca"},{"id":"p16s9","text":"rd grid | 产品官网、功能展示、SaaS 首页、个人主页\nProduct sites, feature walls, SaaS homepages |\n| `cyberpunk` | 赛博朋克"},{"id":"p16s10","text":" / Cyberpunk\nNeon, futuristic glow | 科技产品、AI 工具、游戏、极客向落地页\nTech products, AI tools, games |\n| `vaporw"},{"id":"p16s11","text":"ave` | 蒸汽波 / Vaporwave\nSynthwave, retro-futurism | 艺术项目、音乐/文化向站点、实验性落地页\nArt projects, music/culture "},{"id":"p16s12","text":"sites |\n| `art-deco` | 装饰艺术 / Art Deco\nGold & emerald, 1920s | 高端品牌、奢华酒店、艺术/时尚类站点\nLuxury brands, hot"},{"id":"p16s13","text":"els, art/fashion sites |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Install / 安装"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Or add the repo as a local profile dependency / 或本地安装：把仓库放进\n`$DSH_HOME/profiles/node_modules/`（符号链接）"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"，然后在 profile 的\n`cordis.patch.yml` 中插入 `dsh-design-skills`。"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Usage / 使用"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"在会话中直接说："},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- 「用深色 SaaS 风给我做一个 AI 产品落地页」→ 自动匹配 `dark-saas`\n- 「帮我做一个 Linear 风格的数据看板」→ 自动匹配 `dark-saas`\n- 「做一个苹果官网"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"那种极简的落地页」→ 自动匹配 `apple-minimal`\n- 「Soft UI 风格的个人主页」→ 自动匹配 `neo-neumorphism`"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"技能通过渐进式披露工作：会话开始时模型只看到技能名与描述，\n当任务匹配时才加载完整 SKILL.md（token、组件规则、禁用清单）。"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## How it works / 原理"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- 每个技能是标准的 `skills/<name>/SKILL.md`（YAML frontmatter：`name` + `description` 必填）。\n- `index.js` 以 `ctx"},{"id":"p25s2","text":".skills` provider 形式注册本包全部技能（rank 600，与官方内置同级）。\n- 声明 `dsh.bundle` manifest，可通过 `dsh plugin add` 